Post: hi everyone! i have recently attempted suicide and not many people know about it. i am always alone and when i am alone is when i get depressed the most. i havent had any suicidal thoughts since december up until as recent as valentines day as i have no one to celebrate it with. my dad is also dying from terminal lukemia and we dont exactly know how long he has left. i am on anti depressants and i am going to see my dr tomorrow as i dont think they are working at all. i have been on them since the 1st january and i dont feel any different. i am ok around people but when i am alone is when i get depressed. i cant sleep without the help of medication, i tried earlier this week to sleep without my triazolam and quetiapine but if i dont have them i dont get a wink of sleep and it sucks. i wish i had the luxury of friends my only two friends i have both live in aus and im in nz. i am so close to these 2 that i was andrews best man at his wedding last year in thailand. andrew knows what i have been through recently and josh doesnt as he has alot on his plate currently and i dont want to pile on to his plate. i enjoy gaming, cars,technology and cooking but as of recently with all of this going on i have found myself not enjoying gaming as much as i use too.
